WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:44.219 --> 00:00:49.949
Hello everyone, I hope you you are having
a wonderful December, I certainly have.

00:00:49.949 --> 00:00:56.260
I’ve been spending a lot of time with my
family recently, and this week has been focused

00:00:56.260 --> 00:00:58.719
on trying to create a lot of wonderful memories.

00:00:58.719 --> 00:01:04.429
So, I realized that while I did have some
video projects I was working on nothing was

00:01:04.429 --> 00:01:08.740
going to come together as i anticipated.

00:01:08.740 --> 00:01:15.929
I realized it was important to let that go,
and take some time to be with my family and

00:01:15.929 --> 00:01:20.380
honor that time together.

00:01:20.380 --> 00:01:22.670
My sister is here, Liana.

00:01:22.670 --> 00:01:29.830
She is one of my favorite people in this world
apart from my brother, who is helping me film

00:01:29.830 --> 00:01:32.720
this video.

00:01:32.720 --> 00:01:41.610
Anyway, I know this time of year can be tiring
as well as enjoyable and that you find yourself

00:01:41.610 --> 00:01:42.610
tired in January.

00:01:42.610 --> 00:01:52.280
I am wishing you the best, that you can rest
and recover and embrace the new year as full

00:01:52.280 --> 00:01:54.610
of possibilities.

00:01:54.610 --> 00:02:04.959
And I thought since I wont have my sister
over here anytime soon, I would have her share

00:02:04.959 --> 00:02:06.470
one of her New Years goals.

00:02:06.470 --> 00:02:16.500
Liana: what jumps out at me from what you
shared, is I would say to recenter on gratitude

00:02:16.500 --> 00:02:19.410
and things to be grateful for.

00:02:19.410 --> 00:02:27.881
Not taking for granted basic needs, all the
blessings in our lives, as a family, as individuals,

00:02:27.881 --> 00:02:40.349
and how that can let us grow.

00:02:40.349 --> 00:02:51.151
I’m taking this opportunity to foster that
gratitude with people I love.

00:02:51.151 --> 00:02:54.840
Paola:I would say my New Years resolutions
are quite similar.

00:02:54.840 --> 00:03:04.150
I see in the comments in these videos that
are about happiness and how to find happiness,

00:03:04.150 --> 00:03:09.750
and that usually happiness is more of a location.

00:03:09.750 --> 00:03:14.840
If you just find the right place to live,
the right environment, then you will be happy.

00:03:14.840 --> 00:03:25.150
And definitely I understand that, I have lived
in some nasty places and having a clean and

00:03:25.150 --> 00:03:31.450
safe home is lovely, having access to nature
is lovely.

00:03:31.450 --> 00:03:40.920
But when I think about was has made the most
impact on my joy on a daily basis, it has

00:03:40.920 --> 00:03:41.920
been none of that.

00:03:41.920 --> 00:03:50.190
It’s not about whether or not I have access
to a trail or whether or not i have a cottage

00:03:50.190 --> 00:03:53.660
I can call my own.

00:03:53.660 --> 00:04:03.360
None of those have come close to the impact
of recognizing I have a safe environment.

00:04:03.360 --> 00:04:09.730
Not only a safe environment as in a shelter,
but having people in your life, and only allowing

00:04:09.730 --> 00:04:13.650
people in your life, that make you feel safe.

00:04:13.650 --> 00:04:19.720
I came to appreciate that after experiencing
some relationships that didn’t make me feel

00:04:19.720 --> 00:04:23.979
safe and some environments where I didn’t
feel safe.

00:04:23.979 --> 00:04:33.560
And that is something I really appreciated
after coming to a place i did feel relaxed

00:04:33.560 --> 00:04:35.350
and at ease.

00:04:35.350 --> 00:04:41.550
And that, knowing that the people around you
care about you and will prioritize your safety

00:04:41.550 --> 00:04:47.879
above everything else is something, that not
so many years ago in a not-so-great place,

00:04:47.879 --> 00:04:53.190
I would have given anything for and that is
what keeps me going today.

00:04:53.190 --> 00:04:57.930
No matter where my life takes me, whether
I need to leave this place or go back to the

00:04:57.930 --> 00:05:04.290
city, no matter what I do I am going to be
so grateful I have that.

00:05:04.290 --> 00:05:08.240
That is something so special that we often
take for granted.

00:05:08.240 --> 00:05:13.670
Yeah, in my very short live I truly believe
happiness isn’t a specific location.

00:05:13.670 --> 00:05:19.350
It is something that can be cultivated in
many places and many walks of life as long

00:05:19.350 --> 00:05:27.510
as you have your basic needs met, and I know
not everyone has those basic needs met.

00:05:27.510 --> 00:05:33.800
It can take so much time, and at times is
can feel so discouraging to try to pursue

00:05:33.800 --> 00:05:38.840
and environment that makes you feel your best
and makes you feel safe, and I know that’s

00:05:38.840 --> 00:05:40.010
very hard.

00:05:40.010 --> 00:05:46.199
So, I’m sending you all my love and I hope
you as well can find some lovely New Years

00:05:46.199 --> 00:05:52.540
resolutions that make you excited about all
the possibilities it holds.

00:05:52.540 --> 00:05:59.410
Anyway, I guess that’s what my New Years
resolution is as well, yeah, I really like

00:05:59.410 --> 00:06:03.720
not to make tactile resolutions.

00:06:03.720 --> 00:06:07.840
Every year for a while I would say less ice
cream, and it would fail every time.

00:06:07.840 --> 00:06:10.330
Yeah, I’ve given up on a lot of those things.

00:06:10.330 --> 00:06:18.830
But yeah, my New Years resolution is just
being grateful for safety.

00:06:18.830 --> 00:06:22.170
Fun fact about my sister, she fights.

00:06:22.170 --> 00:06:26.110
Liana:I don’t actually fight.

00:06:26.110 --> 00:06:28.120
I do martial arts.

00:06:28.120 --> 00:06:33.450
Paola: yeah, she does martial arts, she’s
really good.

00:06:33.450 --> 00:06:37.630
Liana: yeah, it’s more like I try to beat
people up and I get beat up, because that’s

00:06:37.630 --> 00:06:39.130
how I learn.

00:06:39.130 --> 00:06:41.000
Paola: She fights, I hike.

00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:43.460
Liana: I like that.

00:06:43.460 --> 00:07:03.110
Paola:Sending you all my love, thank you so
much for being here, and I will see you next

00:07:03.110 --> 00:07:07.449
week.

00:07:07.449 --> 00:07:11.780
Liana:Bye!

00:07:11.780 --> 00:07:20.460
(Family singing)

